  "description": "RFC 0258 §D. The same graph with maxIterations 1 and onExhausted: fail. The first refine loops; a refine on the exhausted second visit emits workflow.loopback-limit, then cap.breached {kind: loopback-iterations}, and fails the run with loop_limit_exceeded naming gate. Conformance scenario: v2-bounded-loopback.test.ts.",
